<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Steinway started outperform.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Steinway started outperform.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Steinway Musical Instruments Inc was started with an outperform rating at Donaldson, Lufkin &amp; Jenrette, according to a market source.</p>
<p>-- Steinway shares rose 1/8 to 16-5/8 in early trading on Friday.</p>
</text>
